  "solution": {
    "text": "DAUGHTER\nTotal words $=8$ !\nTotal words in which vowels are together $=6!\\times 3!$ words in which all vowels are not together\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =8!-6!\\times 3! \\\\\n& =6![56-6] \\\\\n& =720 \\times 50 \\\\\n& =36000\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nAns.(3)",
    "image": null
